1755
01:29:31,670 --> 01:29:35,640
Chess is a game where each piece
has its own role and abilities,

1756
01:29:36,010 --> 01:29:37,740
and you must
use them together effectively...

1757
01:29:38,540 --> 01:29:40,680
to capture your opponent's pieces.

1758
01:29:41,080 --> 01:29:42,620
But in this game,
all the pieces are equal,

1759
01:29:43,050 --> 01:29:46,120
