them into different forms, like Ditto.

1760
01:29:46,120 --> 01:29:47,850
(Rook, Bishop, Knight, Attacker, Jumper)

1761
01:29:47,850 --> 01:29:49,660
On top of the strategic mind games
on the chessboard,

1762
01:29:49,820 --> 01:29:53,630
